// 1-18: the last signal. No colour zones. Pull, yank, swing, true-view stones, a secret chip door. Massive.
id l1-18
name 1-18 LAST SIGNAL
tagline no colours. no zones. just the cable, and a long way home.
bg hall
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main yank white pull
mechanics current:5 plank:4 pull:2 anchor:2 yank:2 neon:5 white:4 secret:1 chip:1
new -
portion 5 pull up the current cliff
portion 6 rail stops short, swing
portion 3 secret wall with a chip
portion 6 long neon/white stone run
portion 5 rail, swing, pull up the tower
hardness 5
map
