text EVERYTHING YOU KNOW. NO COLOUR ZONES.\nPULL. DRIVE. SWING. TRUE VIEW.\nA CHIP FOR THE DOOR — OR CLIMB THE FACE.
text JACK THE PLATFORM. STEP ON. DRIVE IT.\nTHE RAIL STOPS SHORT. LOOK UP FOR THE ANCHOR.\nSWING THE REST.
text THAT WALL ISN'T A WALL.\nHOLD {recal} AND WALK THROUGH.\nA DATA CHIP HIDES IN THE SIDE CHAMBER.
text NEON GOES WHEN YOU HOLD {recal}. WHITE ONLY COMES WHEN YOU DO.\nTHE STONES TAKE TURNS. SWITCH IN THE AIR.
text ONE LAST RAIL, THEN THE TOWER.\nSLOT THE CHIP FOR THE DOOR — OR PULL UP THE FACE.\nTHE CURRENT ONLY REACHES SO HIGH.
